<title>CANADA: Toronto market won't add Bre-X to indexes.</title>
<headline>Toronto market won't add Bre-X to indexes.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Toronto Stock Exchange said on Thursday it would not add Bre-X Minerals Ltd to the market's indexes at this time in view of the continuing uncertainty concerning Bre-X and the need to maintain the integrity of the indexes.</p>
<p>The exchange said a replacement stock would be announced after the close today to be effective before the opening on Monday.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416-941-8100))</p>
</text>
